    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p13-q15-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Write down the expansion of $(a+b)^2$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^2+2ab+b^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(a+b)^2&=a(a+b)+b(a+b)\\\\(a+b)^2&=a^2+2ab+b^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q15-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Use the expansion in part a to square $\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2$",
          "worked": "Use the expansion with $a=\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}$ and $b=-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}\\right)^2&=(6+\\sqrt{11})-2\\sqrt{(6+\\sqrt{11})(6-\\sqrt{11})}+(6-\\sqrt{11})\\\\\\left(\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}\\right)^2&=12-2\\sqrt{36-11}\\\\\\left(\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}\\right)^2&=12-2\\times5\\\\\\left(\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}\\right)^2&=2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q15-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Hence simplify $\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sqrt{2}$\n\nThe expression is positive and its square is $2$.",
          "worked": "Since $6+\\sqrt{11}>6-\\sqrt{11}>0$, the difference of their square roots is positive. From part b, its square is $2$, so\n$$\\sqrt{6+\\sqrt{11}}-\\sqrt{6-\\sqrt{11}}=\\sqrt{2}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      }
    ]
  },
